- Quantitative comparisons between novice and professional drawings to illustrate the similarities and differences for inspiring the design of sketch-based interfaces and line drawing algorithms;
- Two applications enabled by our dataset: 1) a novel freehandstyle sketch synthesis method; 2) a potential benchmark for sketch-based 3D reconstruction.
